# Keys pressed together land a tick or two apart on a keyboard (W D and flip, 2026-11-16).
# W held, J pressed, D two ticks later: within tricks.dirTicks (5) of J the held up grows into up right,
# and the flip is the Inward Heelflip, not the Impossible.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
hold up 94..99
tap flip 96
hold right 98..101
run 300
expect event trickStart{trick=Impossible} within 97..97
expect event trickStart{trick=Inward Heelflip} within 99..99
expect event comboLanded{name=Inward Heelflip,points=400} within 160..240
expect no event bail
